A third Форма option lets the client buy a strip of full sheet width
and a chosen length. Width is locked to sh.sheetW automatically — the
input is shown disabled with the current sheet width and stays in sync
when the sheet size changes (data-size or data-custom-w handlers).

Packing treats a strip as a regular rectangle of (sheetW × length), so
it slots in like any other piece — typically the strips stack across
the bottom or top of the layout. Holes modal opens with the effective
size (sheetW × length). The client-view table labels strips
explicitly as "відрізок (повна ширина)".

https://claude.ai/code/session_01KRiYiZuZmYp9DJQaqQefQF
